<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-BECKER BEATS SAMPRAS IN STUTTGART OPEN FINAL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BECKER BEATS SAMPRAS IN STUTTGART OPEN FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final in</p>
<p>the $2.2 million Stuttgart Open ATP tennis tournament on Sunday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>6-Boris Becker (Germany) beat 1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) 3-6 6-3 3-6</p>
<p>6-3 6-4</p>
</text>
